   1506  f970							; via the $F9AC shared pad (`sta $1FF8 / jmp $F970`; 0 pushes). Bank2-
   1507  f970							; only job (P2b stager): the packed meta (TilePF0+9/+10) lives in THIS
   1508  f970							; bank's ROM — read the door flags + left-strip dcol, stage them, let
   1509  f970							; bank1 StripBlastCheck run BOTH overlap takes (the blast window is
   1510  f970							; left-half cols 0..19 and stays READ-ONLY here).
   1511  f970							; Staging contract (both scratch bytes free in this flow):
   1512  f970							;   RectCount := 2ℓ left-strip dcol, or $FF = none/door/right-bomb;
   1513  f970							;   Temp ($88 = bank1 BMWScratch) := $FF when MetaB b7 (right door)
   1514  f970							;   so the ball-strip take can never fire. Key pickup (P5) sets b3/b4
   1515  f970							;   for doors instead (comment hook at the takes).
