   1588  fae9							; Walks the hot-stream $80 records [class, 2c, row, 2, 1] and toggles
   1589  fae9							; the cell's two PF bits per EnemyRamP bit5 (64f cycle: 32 ON + 32
   1590  fae9							; OFF). The PF buffers are the collision map — render, PHM, and the
   1591  fae9							; laser all follow the blink for free. $81/$82 (vcrunch/hcrunch)
   1592  fae9							; tramp to bank3 (CrunchClock ping-pong staging — Phase 4); legacy
   1593  fae9							; hot rects are skipped. CollisionEndY ($8F) is
   1594  fae9							; scratch: the pack rebuild in StageBandTab overwrites it right
   1595  fae9							; after the call returns.
   1596  fae9				   PhaseBlink
