   1598  fae9							; arm overwrites for shutter rooms). Runs every VBL this routine does —
   1599  fae9							; bank1 HUD already stomped $EA/$EB/$EC after the cave, so a full
   1600  fae9							; restage here is the only way the next kernel reads sane values.
   1601  fae9							; Idle defaults: VcrBand=$FF (tail dispatch never matches), VcrNext=0
   1602  fae9							; (idle marker — only 1..4 slices), VcrState=0. The band0 length needs
