   1975  fcf0							; C=1 to the ORIGINAL PlayerHitsMap caller. Exits therefore end
   1976  fcf0							; `sec / jmp $FBF8` (ReturnPad: sta $1FF6 switches to bank0, rts pops the
   1977  fcf0							; pre-tramp return address; sta touches neither A nor flags -> C survives).
