   2079  fd78							; Feature-record dispatch ($80 phase / $81 vcrunch / $82 hcrunch — Phase 4):
   2080  fd78							; armed/overlap/kill tests live in bank3 (HOVFeatEntry). $80 phase: b5 armed
   2081  fd78							; (staged by PhaseBlink each VBL) + candidate-box overlap → shared Hot hit
   2082  fd78							; (Temp b7 → bank0 `jsr LoseLife`); kill gated on armed-and-not-removed
   2083  fd78							; (`and #$60 / cmp #$20`), latches b6, PhaseBlink punch forced OFF while b6
   2084  fd78							; set (walls REMOVED, same-room only — EnterRoom zeroes the mask).
   2085  fd78							; $81 vcrunch: sprite shutter — the kill rides the OverlayTramp MISS path
   2086  fd78							; (OvShutTest/OvShutBand, MetaB b7 gate) because the punched cell never
   2087  fd78							; trips this walk. The record path (loop push + HOVFeatPre's 4 field pushes
   2088  fd78							; + bank3 jsr HOVvcrunch) measured SP=$F6 = real BombTimer ($F7) stomp
   2089  fd78							; (sim_bomb_fuse mirror stomp, 2026-10-13) — skip the record here.
   2090  fd78							; Entered with Y = record base + pushed Y (loop invariant), A = mask.
   2091  fd78							; 15B kept: the cmp/beq/jmp + pad replace the old tramp byte-for-byte —
   2092  fd78							; the BombEnemyBlastBody $FD87 pin (kernel tramp operand) must not move.
   2093  fd78				   .HOVfeature
   2094  fd78		       c9 81		      cmp	#$81
   2095  fd7a		       f0 ef		      beq	HOVnext	; vcrunch skip (HOVnext pops the loop Y)
   2096  fd7c		       4c fc fb 	      jmp	HOVFeatPre	; → pre-read fields (bank2 ROM) → bank3 dispatch
   2097  fd7f		       00 00 00 00*	      .ds	8, 0	; pad: 2+2+3+8 = 15B = old body size
