   2100  fd87							; BombEnemyBlast body — kill first live enemy |dcol| < 2 (any Y). Type check:
   2101  fd87							; LAMP (5) is NOT killable — the old inline loop set the dead bit on lamps too
   2102  fd87							; (lost lamp, no dark-room trigger, +50 score for nothing — bugs.md 3).
   2103  fd87							; Entered from bank0 stub (sta $1FF8 / jmp <here> — operand in kernel.asm,
   2104  fd87							; twin at $FDD8 below), 0 pushes; every exit `jmp $FBF8` ReturnPad.
