   2335  fe9c							; Phase B). Entered from PHMOverlay .OvBand (right-column + player-band
   2336  fe9c							; overlap). The punched cell no longer trips the PF cell walk, so the overlay
   2337  fe9c							; path IS the kill trigger: MetaB b7 (convert's shutter flag) gates it; plain
